# Only this folder's README, the product & design spec and the design-token file are
# committed. The page exports stay on Fatih's machine (decided 2026-09-17): they carry
# placeholder data and claims the project never made. See README.md.
# `git add -f` overrides these rules; they stop accidents, not decisions.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/EVERGREEN-PRODUCT-AND-DESIGN-SPEC.md
!/evergreen_protocol/
/evergreen_protocol/*
!/evergreen_protocol/DESIGN.md
